			<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.age to 0>>
			The <<person>> suddenly braces, fighting with the line as it pulls <<his>> rod around. Then <<he>> jolts back as whatever was on the line escapes.
			<<if $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk gte 3>>
