:: Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Accept
The <<person>> snatches it from your hands and staggers off the pier, muttering about "respekt" and "my spot." 
<br><br>

<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "finished">>
<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Refuse
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"But I caught it... it's mine."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Not a chance. Get your own."
<<else>>
	"No. I caught it."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> narrows <<his>> eyes. "I tend to take what I want," <<he>> says as <<he>> strides towards you.
