		<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<He>> stumbles back, gasping. <<He>> looks at you for a moment, then turns and walks off down the pier.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


/* ========================== */
/* ===== Combat Widgets ===== */
/* ========================== */


:: Widgets Fishing Pier Fisher Combat [widget]

<<widget "fishCombatPierCaughtFisherDrunk">>
	<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
	<<run updateFishRecord($fishingHookedFish.type, $fishingHookedFish.size, "pier")>>
	<<run endFishingCombat()>>
	<<run holdCaughtFish($fishingHookedFish.type)>>
	
	<<fishingCatchFishText "pier">>
	<br><br>

	The <<person>> stares at your catch for a moment, eyes narrowing. <<He>> straightens up unsteadily and takes a step toward you. "That one's mine, I had a line right there. Hand it over."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Give <<him>> the fish|Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Accept]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Refuse]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishCombatPierOrgasmFisher">>
	<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
	<<set _orgasmText to either("You grab the pier railing with your free hand", "You press yourself hard against the railing")>>
	<<orgasm>>
	<<= _orgasmText>> as your body convulses in climax. The rod slips and the line goes slack. The <<print $fishingHookedFish.type>> is long gone. "Hell of a catch," the <<person>> calls over, laughing. <<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<fameexhibitionism 10>>
	<<run endFishingCombat()>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>
